  "Expand row once per carrier, (row level lurker box meters): the lurker named lurker of level carries the eco of the box named
   box, and stood meters from it when placed."
  `(,join
     (,row beach "lurkerpuppy-5" "crate-213" 24.7)
     (,row beach "lurkerpuppy-6" "crate-213" 33.3)
